    contentList:
    - Oh my god! What have you done! Ducklings are gone!
    - Ducks are now in better places, unfortunately they aren't gonna be here anymore.
    - John Quackna stole all of your ducks.
    - You are now officially fired from Quack land.
    - No:(.
    - Bad Mayor!
    - I can believe I have to fire a bad mayor twice.
    - Go find another job.
    - Open your mind Mr.Kennedy.
    - This shall be your final fantasy Mr. Mayor.
    - It's a beautiful day outside. Birds are singing, flowers are blooming. . .
      On days like these, mayors like you. . . Should be burning in hell.
    - I guess you are not quacklified enough.
    - This ends, right here*KATANA NOISES*.
    - You are the worst egg in the nest.
    - Get more quacky and come back.
    - "You are so quack\u2019in stupid, why?"
    - Oh quack, seriously?
    - For the love of the crumbs, how did you do this?
    - "Well, you can\u2019t expect to win them all."
    - Hey chat, what should we do now?
